WEBVTT

00:54:58.913 --> 00:55:02.371
slow down and build beautiful
things that are built on

00:55:02.371 --> 00:55:08.704
a real version of human nature and on
a real version of system complexity

00:55:08.913 --> 00:55:11.996
and the risks associated with
systemic complexity.

00:55:12.538 --> 00:55:15.829
Is that the agenda that fundamentally
you think that you can push somehow?

00:55:16.538 --> 00:55:21.038
Yes, but I think the way we can push it is
by getting the incentive system right.

00:55:21.538 --> 00:55:24.454
I think most people are fundamentally
extremely good.

00:55:25.204 --> 00:55:28.079
Very few people wake up in the morning
thinking about how can I make the world

00:55:28.079 --> 00:55:32.996
a worse place? But the incentive systems
that we're in are so powerful.